  "prefLabel": "Tax 201.13 Conduct of Parties, Attorneys, Agents, and Municipal Consultants",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 201.13 Conduct of Parties, Attorneys, Agents, and Municipal Consultants. Parties, attorneys, agents, and municipal consultants shall conduct themselves in a truthful and respectful manner in all of their dealings with the board and other parties, attorneys, and agents.\n\nSource. #5638, eff 9-1-93; ss by #7068, INTERIM, eff 8-15-99, EXPIRES, 12-13-99; ss by #7153, eff 12-10-99; ss by #8986, eff 9-24-07; ss by #10624, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13687, eff 7-19-23",
